WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:05.755
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.133
[Officer Cisneros]
A suit machine gun.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:17.267
Okay, I can see by the
mechanism that this isn't a toy.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.478
Has a magazine.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.439
It's an airsoft magazine.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.024
Shoots pellets.

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.109
The problem that
we have with this,

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:32.032
it must have a orange tip
that is attached to it that

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:33.783
you cannot remove.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.909
This one doesn't have it.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.119
This is just painted.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.371
So that's not, a no-no for us.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:42.083
And plus, this is a
very realistic looking gun.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:47.464
When this realistic gun
is in the hands of a child,

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:52.510
if a police officer comes by
and sees somebody pointing this

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:56.181
gun to kids, what do you think
that this officer will do?

00:00:56.264 --> 00:01:00.810
Will actually meet the guy
with the gun with deadly force.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.897
There is no need in our
society to have realistic

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.107
guns in the playground.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.234
There is no need for it.

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:12.113
If we cannot confiscate
it by the orange tips,

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.574
I see "Made in Wisconsin,
United States."

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:16.993
If it was made in
Wisconsin, United States,

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.870
why is it coming from Europe?

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:21.247
Also they have the trademark.

00:01:21.372 --> 00:01:25.919
So we have some grounds to
actually confiscate this gun

00:01:26.044 --> 00:01:28.421
as an IPR,
Intellectual Property Rights,

00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:31.508
violation or look for
more information about,

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.511
you know, how we can go around
and trying to stop this gun

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:37.388
from reaching our population.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.183
Let's see what else we have.

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:42.977
So now we're gonna X-ray those,

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.939
this big parcels.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:47.982
Okay, what do we have here?

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:48.983
Hmm.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:53.279
This one seems that the
middle part is very dense.

00:01:55.907 --> 00:01:59.577
The parcel's coming from
Poland and it's going to L.A.

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.457
And we have here puzzles.

00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:08.294
Whoa.

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:10.922
Okay, this looks
like something else.

00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:14.008
So what I'm gonna do
now is gonna put my mask,

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:17.470
make sure that we
take all the precautions.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.059
So I'm gonna just
make a little cut.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:25.478
So let me just rip this.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:29.524
And bingo.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.318
I see pills here.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:38.950
And we have another one.

00:02:40.368 --> 00:02:42.620
More pills here.

00:02:42.704 --> 00:02:44.497
And here we go, that's the way.

00:02:44.581 --> 00:02:45.415
Same.

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:49.002
So I'm gonna smash them
and then test them to find out

00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:50.587
what substance we have here.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.922
[thudding]

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:06.394
Now we've got MDMA.

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:19.157
We're gonna wrap everything up,

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.117
we're gonna set
everything where it belongs,

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:23.369
and we're gonna send it
for controlled delivery.

00:03:23.453 --> 00:03:27.040
So the bad guy, when
somebody's knocking at the door,

00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:29.584
might be a federal officer,
where you're gonna spend

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.545
a long, long time
in the penitentiary.

